            text: '<details>\n<summary> 思考过程</summary>\n\n<thinking>\n现在已经查询到所有相关模块的详细信息。让我整理一下：\n\n**已查询的模块信息：**\n1. cellAnnotation (cell2location)\n2. cell2locationMakeRef（辅助任务）\n3. spatialDomain (graphST)\n4. DEG\n5. CCI (cellchat)\n6. inferCNV\n7. geneSetEnrichment (gsea, enrichr, prerank)\n8. h5ad2rds（格式转换）\n\n**分析用户需求对应的流程：**\n\n基于用户的研究目标：解析结直肠癌肿瘤微环境空间格局，重点探索肿瘤-基质边界特征及其对免疫治疗疗效的影响\n\n这是多片分析（两个样本：CRCP99_T和CRCP100_T），根据workflow_pipeline_rules中的多片流程：\n\n**主要分析路径：**\n1. **细胞注释路径**：\n   - cell2locationMakeRef（准备参考数据）\n   - cellAnnotation (cell2location) - 识别肿瘤微环境中的细胞类型\n   - h5ad2rds（格式转换）\n   - inferCNV - 识别肿瘤细胞的CNV特征\n   - CCI - 分析细胞间通讯\n   - DEG - 比较不同样本或细胞类型的差异基因\n   - enrichr/prerank - 差异基因的功能富集\n\n2. **空间结构域路径**：\n   - spatialDomain (graphST) - 识别肿瘤-基质边界等空间区域\n   - gsea - 通路富集分析\n\n**任务依赖关系：**\n1. cell2locationMakeRef 必须在 cellAnnotation 之前执行\n2. h5ad2rds 需要在 cellAnnotation 之后、inferCNV/CCI 之前执行\n3. DEG 可以基于 cellAnnotation 的结果\n4. enrichr/prerank 需要 DEG 的输出\n\n**完整的任务流程图：**\n```\nsingle_cell.h5ad → cell2locationMakeRef → reference.csv\n                                             ↓\nstereo_bin100.h5ad ────────────────→ cellAnnotation (cell2location) → anno.h5ad\n                                             ↓                              ↓\n                                      spatialDomain (graphST)         h5ad2rds\n                                             ↓                              ↓\n                                        domain.h5ad                     anno.rds\n                                             ↓                              ↓\n                                          gsea                    ┌─────────┴─────────┐\n                                                                  ↓                   ↓\n                                                             inferCNV               CCI\n                                                                  ↓\n                                                              DEG (基于cellAnnotation)\n                                                                  ↓\n                                                        ┌────────┴────────┐\n                                                        ↓                 ↓\n                                                    enrichr           prerank\n```\n\n**需要用户确认的参数（根据rag查询结果）：**\n\n1. **cell2locationMakeRef**（必填）：\n   - reference: /data/StereoAgent/luhuifang/data/SDAS_Application_cases/Application_test_data/single_cell.h5ad\n   - output: /data/zhanhaojia/test/reproduction_code/cell2location_ref\n   - label_key: 需要用户指定（单细胞数据中的细胞类型列名）\n   - cell_percentage_cutoff2: 0.03（默认，可调整）\n   - nonz_mean_cutoff: 1.12（默认，可调整）\n\n2. **cellAnnotation (cell2location)**（必填）：\n   - input: /data/zhanhaojia/inputs/reproduction_code/stereo_bin100.h5ad\n   - output: /data/zhanhaojia/test/reproduction_code/cellAnnotation\n   - reference_csv: cell2locationMakeRef的输出\n   - bin_size: 需要确认（100？）\n   - slice_key: 需要确认（sampleID？）\n\n3. **spatialDomain (graphST)**（必填）：\n   - input: cellAnnotation的输出h5ad\n   - output: /data/zhanhaojia/test/reproduction_code/spatialDomain\n   - n_clusters: 需要用户指定或让Agent推荐\n   - bin_size: 100\n\n4. **h5ad2rds**（必填）：\n   - input: cellAnnotation的输出h5ad\n   - output: /data/zhanhaojia/test/reproduction_code/rds_files\n\n5. **inferCNV**（必填）：\n   - input: h5ad2rds的输出rds\n   - h5ad: cellAnnotation的输出h5ad\n   - output: /data/zhanhaojia/test/reproduction_code/inferCNV\n   - label_key: cellAnnotation生成的注释列名\n   - bin_size: 100\n   - ref_group_names: 需要用户指定参考细胞类型（如正常细胞）\n\n6. **CCI (cellchat)**（必填）：\n   - input: h5ad2rds的输出rds（但CCI接受h5ad！需要修正）\n   - 实际上CCI的input参数接受h5ad文件，不需要转rds\n   - output: /data/zhanhaojia/test/reproduction_code/CCI\n   - label_key: cellAnnotation生成的注释列名\n   - species: human\n\n7. **DEG**（必填）：\n   - input: cellAnnotation的输出h5ad\n   - output: /data/zhanhaojia/test/reproduction_code/DEG\n   - de_method: 需要用户选择或让Agent推荐（wilcoxon/t-test/MAST等）\n   - group_key: cellAnnotation生成的注释列名或样本列名\n   - ident1: 需要用户指定（比较组）\n   - ident2: 需要用户指定（对照组）\n\n8. **gsea**（必填）：\n   - input: spatialDomain的输出h5ad\n   - output: /data/zhanhaojia/test/reproduction_code/gsea\n   - species: human\n   - group_key: domain_graphst\n   - ident1: 需要用户指定\n   - ident2: 需要用户指定\n   - gmt: 需要用户指定或让Agent推荐\n\n9. **enrichr**（必填）：\n   - input: DEG的输出csv（sig_filtered.csv）\n   - output: /data/zhanhaojia/test/reproduction_code/enrichr\n   - species: human\n\n10. **prerank**（必填）：\n    - input: DEG的输出csv（all.csv）\n    - output: /data/zhanhaojia/test/reproduction_code/prerank\n\n等等，我需要重新检查CCI模块的输入要求。根据查询结果，CCI cellchat的input参数接受h5ad文件，不是rds文件！所以不需要h5ad2rds转换。\n\n但是inferCNV需要rds文件，所以还是需要h5ad2rds转换，但只用于inferCNV。\n\n让我重新梳理流程：\n\n```\nsingle_cell.h5ad → cell2locationMakeRef → reference.csv\n                                             ↓\nstereo_bin100.h5ad ────────────────→ cellAnnotation → anno.h5ad\n                                             ↓\n                        ┌────────────────────┼────────────────────┐\n                        ↓                    ↓                    ↓\n                 spatialDomain            h5ad2rds              CCI\n                        ↓                    ↓                    \n                    domain.h5ad          anno.rds                \n                        ↓                    ↓                    \n                     gsea                inferCNV                \n                                             \n                 DEG (基于cellAnnotation的anno.h5ad)\n                        ↓\n                  ┌─────┴─────┐\n                  ↓           ↓\n              enrichr     prerank\n```\n\n现在需要生成表单。根据user_input_collection_rule，我需要：\n1. 一次性收集所有必要信息\n2. 为技术性字段提供"让Agent自动推荐"选项\n3. 基于rag查询结果预填默认值\n4. 确保字段类型只有radio、checkbox、textarea\n\n表单应该包含：\n- 固定必需字段：研究目标、物种、组织类型、样本信息\n- 数据相关：数据路径（已提供）、单细胞参考数据中的细胞类型列名\n- 分析配置：各模块的算法选择和参数\n- 输出配置：输出路径（已提供）\n\n需要特别注意的技术性字段（应提供自动推荐选项）：\n- label_key（单细胞数据中的细胞类型列名）\n- slice_key（空间数据中的样本列名）\n- bin_size\n- n_clusters（聚类数）\n- ref_group_names（参考细胞类型）\n- de_method（差异分析方法）\n- DEG和gsea的比较组设置\n</thinking>\n\n</details>\n\n现在我已经查询了所有相关模块的详细信息。基于您的研究目标，我为您设计了完整的分析流程：\n\n## 📊 分析流程设计\n\n### 研究目标理解\n您希望解析结直肠癌肿瘤微环境的空间格局，重点关注：\n- 肿瘤与基质边界的细胞与分子特征\n- 不同分子分型及免疫治疗应答的差异\n- 免疫检查点抑制剂疗效差异的影响机制\n\n### 完整分析流程图\n\n```mermaid\nflowchart TD\n    A[单细胞参考数据<br/>single_cell.h5ad] --> B[cell2locationMakeRef<br/>准备参考数据]\n    B --> C[reference.csv]\n    \n    D[空间数据<br/>stereo_bin100.h5ad] --> E[cellAnnotation<br/>cell2location细胞注释]\n    C --> E\n    \n    E --> F[anno.h5ad<br/>带细胞类型注释]\n    \n    F --> G[spatialDomain<br/>graphST空间区域识别]\n    F --> H[CCI<br/>细胞通讯分析]\n    F --> I[h5ad2rds<br/>格式转换]\n    F --> J[DEG<br/>差异基因分析]\n    \n    G --> K[domain.h5ad<br/>带空间区域标签]\n    I --> L[anno.rds]\n    \n    K --> M[gsea<br/>通路富集分析]\n    L --> N[inferCNV<br/>拷贝数变异分析]\n    \n    J --> O[DEG结果<br/>all.csv & sig_filtered.csv]\n    O --> P[enrichr<br/>功能富集分析]\n    O --> Q[prerank<br/>通路富集分析]\n```\n\n### 分析流程说明\n\n**主要执行路径：**\n\n**路径1：细胞注释 → 细胞通讯 → 拷贝数分析**\n- `cell2locationMakeRef` → `cellAnnotation` → `CCI` + `inferCNV`\n- 目的：识别肿瘤微环境细胞类型，分析细胞间通讯，识别肿瘤细胞CNV特征\n\n**路径2：空间结构域 → 通路分析**\n- `cellAnnotation` → `spatialDomain` → `gsea`\n- 目的：识别肿瘤-基质边界等空间区域，分析区域间通路差异\n\n**路径3：差异基因 → 功能富集**\n- `cellAnnotation` → `DEG` → `enrichr` + `prerank`\n- 目的：识别不同样本/区域的差异基因，探索影响免疫治疗疗效的机制\n\n### 任务连接依据\n\n✅ **cell2locationMakeRef → cellAnnotation**: cell2location需要先准备单细胞参考数据\n✅ **cellAnnotation → spatialDomain**: spatialDomain需要细胞注释信息作为辅助\n✅ **cellAnnotation → h5ad2rds → inferCNV**: inferCNV要求rds格式输入\n✅ **cellAnnotation → CCI**: CCI基于细胞注释分析通讯网络\n✅ **cellAnnotation → DEG**: DEG基于细胞类型或样本进行差异分析\n✅ **spatialDomain → gsea**: gsea基于空间区域进行通路富集\n✅ **DEG → enrichr/prerank**: 富集分析需要差异基因列表\n\n现在让我为您生成完整的参数配置表单...\n\n<FORM_CONFIG>{"formType":"complete_analysis_config","title":"结直肠癌肿瘤微环境空间分析 - 完整参数配置","description":"一次性配置所有分析参数，避免后续重复输入","fields":[{"type":"textarea","label":"研究目标","name":"research_goal","required":true,"placeholder":"请描述您的具体研究目标","value":"解析结直肠癌患者在不同分子分型及免疫治疗应答背景下的肿瘤微环境空间格局，重点探索肿瘤与基质边界的细胞与分子特征，以及其对免疫检查点抑制剂疗效差异的影响机制"},{"type":"radio","label":"物种","name":"species","required":true,"value":"human","options":[{"value":"human","label":"人类 (Human)"},{"value":"mouse","label":"小鼠 (Mouse)"},{"value":"other","label":"其他物种","has_input":true,"input_name":"species_other","placeholder":"请填写物种名称","input_required":true,"input_value":""}]},{"type":"radio","label":"组织类型","name":"tissue_type","required":true,"value":"colorectal_cancer","options":[{"value":"colorectal_cancer","label":"结直肠癌"},{"value":"other_cancer","label":"其他肿瘤","has_input":true,"input_name":"tissue_type_other","placeholder":"请填写组织类型","input_required":true,"input_value":""}]},{"type":"textarea","label":"样本信息","name":"sample_info","required":true,"placeholder":"请描述样本的详细信息","value":"两个结直肠癌样本：CRCP99_T和CRCP100_T，来自不同患者的肿瘤组织切片"},{"type":"textarea","label":"空间转录组数据路径","name":"spatial_data_path","required":true,"placeholder":"请输入h5ad文件的完整路径","value":"/data/zhanhaojia/inputs/reproduction_code/stereo_bin100.h5ad"},{"type":"textarea","label":"单细胞参考数据路径","name":"sc_reference_path","required":true,"placeholder":"请输入单细胞h5ad文件的完整路径","value":"/data/StereoAgent/luhuifang/data/SDAS_Application_cases/Application_test_data/single_cell.h5ad"},{"type":"textarea","label":"输出结果路径","name":"output_path","required":true,"placeholder":"请输入输出目录的完整路径","value":"/data/zhanhaojia/test/reproduction_code"},{"type":"radio","label":"单细胞数据中的细胞类型列名 (label_key)","name":"sc_label_key","required":true,"value":"auto_recommend","options":[{"value":"auto_recommend","label":"让Agent自动推荐（检查数据后确定）"},{"value":"cell_type","label":"cell_type"},{"value":"celltype","label":"celltype"},{"value":"annotation","label":"annotation"},{"value":"custom","label":"自定义","has_input":true,"input_name":"sc_label_key_custom","placeholder":"请输入列名","input_required":true,"input_value":""}]},{"type":"radio","label":"空间数据中的样本列名 (slice_key)","name":"slice_key","required":true,"value":"auto_recommend","options":[{"value":"auto_recommend","label":"让Agent自动推荐（检查数据后确定）"},{"value":"sampleID","label":"sampleID（推荐）"},{"value":"sample","label":"sample"},{"value":"custom","label":"自定义","has_input":true,"input_name":"slice_key_custom","placeholder":"请输入列名","input_required":true,"input_value":""}]},{"type":"radio","label":"Bin大小","name":"bin_size","required":true,"value":"100","options":[{"value":"100","label":"100（推荐，适合组织结构分析）"},{"value":"50","label":"50（中等分辨率）"},{"value":"20","label":"20（高分辨率）"}]},{"type":"textarea","label":"参考数据准备参数 - cell_percentage_cutoff2","name":"cell_percentage_cutoff2","required":false,"placeholder":"控制基因筛选，推荐0.03-0.05","value":"0.03"},{"type":"textarea","label":"参考数据准备参数 - nonz_mean_cutoff","name":"nonz_mean_cutoff","required":false,"placeholder":"控制基因筛选，推荐1.12-1.45","value":"1.12"},{"type":"radio","label":"空间结构域聚类数 (n_clusters)","name":"n_clusters","required":true,"value":"auto_recommend","options":[{"value":"auto_recommend","label":"让Agent自动推荐（基于数据特征）"},{"value":"8","label":"8个区域"},{"value":"10","label":"10个区域（推荐）"},{"value":"12","label":"12个区域"},{"value":"custom","label":"自定义","has_input":true,"input_name":"n_clusters_custom","placeholder":"请输入聚类数","input_required":true,"input_value":""}]},{"type":"radio","label":"参考细胞类型 (inferCNV分析用)","name":"ref_cell_types","required":true,"value":"auto_recommend","options":[{"value":"auto_recommend","label":"让Agent自动推荐（基于细胞注释结果）"},{"value":"normal_epithelial","label":"正常上皮细胞"},{"value":"fibroblast","label":"成纤维细胞"},{"value":"endothelial","label":"内皮细胞"},{"value":"custom","label":"自定义","has_input":true,"input_name":"ref_cell_types_custom","placeholder":"请输入参考细胞类型，多个用逗号分隔","input_required":true,"input_value":""}]},{"type":"radio","label":"差异基因分析方法 (DEG)","name":"deg_method","required":true,"value":"wilcoxon","options":[{"value":"wilcoxon","label":"Wilcoxon秩和检验（推荐，非参数方法）"},{"value":"t-test","label":"t检验（参数方法）"},{"value":"MAST","label":"MAST（单细胞专用）"},{"value":"DESeq2","label":"DESeq2（需要生物学重复≥3）"},{"value":"edgeR","label":"edgeR（需要生物学重复≥2）"}]},{"type":"radio","label":"差异基因分析 - 比较策略","name":"deg_comparison_strategy","required":true,"value":"auto_recommend","options":[{"value":"auto_recommend","label":"让Agent自动推荐（基于研究目标）"},{"value":"sample_comparison","label":"样本间比较（CRCP99_T vs CRCP100_T）"},{"value":"cell_type_comparison","label":"细胞类型间比较（如肿瘤细胞 vs 基质细胞）"},{"value":"spatial_domain_comparison","label":"空间区域间比较（如肿瘤区 vs 基质区）"}]},{"type":"radio","label":"GSEA通路数据库","name":"gsea_database","required":true,"value":"auto_recommend","options":[{"value":"auto_recommend","label":"让Agent自动推荐（免疫相关通路）"},{"value":"hallmark","label":"Hallmark基因集（推荐）"},{"value":"kegg","label":"KEGG通路"},{"value":"go_bp","label":"GO生物学过程"},{"value":"immunologic","label":"免疫相关基因集"}]},{"type":"checkbox","label":"需要执行的分析模块","name":"analysis_modules","required":true,"value":["cellAnnotation","spatialDomain","inferCNV","CCI","DEG","gsea","enrichr"],"options":[{"value":"cellAnnotation","label":"细胞注释（必需，识别细胞类型）"},{"value":"spatialDomain","label":"空间结构域识别（推荐，识别肿瘤-基质边界）"},{"value":"inferCNV","label":"拷贝数变异分析（推荐，识别肿瘤细胞）"},{"value":"CCI","label":"细胞通讯分析（推荐，分析细胞间互作）"},{"value":"DEG","label":"差异基因分析（必需，比较组间差异）"},{"value":"gsea","label":"GSEA通路富集（推荐，空间区域通路分析）"},{"value":"enrichr","label":"Enrichr功能富集（推荐，差异基因功能注释）"},{"value":"prerank","label":"Prerank富集分析（可选，差异基因通路分析）"}]},{"type":"radio","label":"是否使用GPU加速","name":"use_gpu","required":true,"value":"yes","options":[{"value":"yes","label":"是（推荐，显著加快cell2location运行速度）"},{"value":"no","label":"否（使用CPU）"}]},{"type":"textarea","label":"GPU设备ID","name":"gpu_id","required":false,"placeholder":"如使用GPU，请输入GPU编号，如0或1，-1表示CPU","value":"0"},{"type":"radio","label":"输出图片格式","name":"figure_format","required":true,"value":"both","options":[{"value":"both","label":"PNG和PDF（推荐）"},{"value":"png","label":"仅PNG"},{"value":"pdf","label":"仅PDF"}]},{"type":"textarea","label":"其他特殊需求或备注","name":"additional_notes","required":false,"placeholder":"如有其他特殊需求或参数设置建议，请在此说明","value":""}]}</FORM_CONFIG>\n\n---\n\n### 📋 表单填写说明\n\n**已预填信息：**\n- ✅ 研究目标、物种、组织类型、样本信息\n- ✅ 数据路径和输出路径\n- ✅ 推荐的分析参数和默认值\n\n**需要您确认的关键项：**\n1. **单细胞数据中的细胞类型列名**：如不确定，选择"让Agent自动推荐"\n2. **空间结构域聚类数**：推荐10个，或让Agent根据数据特征推荐\n3. **参考细胞类型**：用于CNV分析，如不确定选择"让Agent自动推荐"\n4. **差异分析比较策略**：样本间、细胞类型间或空间区域间比较\n\n**一键配置选项：**\n- 所有技术性参数都提供了"让Agent自动推荐"选项\n- 默认已选中推荐的分析模块组合\n- 所有参数都有专家建议的默认值\n\n请填写完表单后回复"表单已填写完成，请继续"，我将立即生成详细的分析计划并转交给task_agent执行。'
